  "description": "A high-performance WinUI 3 text editor control for .NET 8 with Win2D viewport rendering, editing, selection, undo/redo, search and replace, syntax highlighting, line numbers, zoom, line and text-range decorations, virtualized gutter markers, and incremental document change notifications.",
