  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Retargeted the control to .NET 8 and Windows App SDK 2.2.\n\t\t\tAdded universal line, gutter, and text-range decorations with viewport-aware rendering.\n\t\t\tAdded incremental document change notifications and stateful multi-line syntax highlighting.\n\t\t\tAdded per-control semantic syntax palettes and configurable editor layout extensions.\n\t\t\tAdded detailed diagnostics when a syntax highlighting rule is quarantined after a regex timeout.\n\t\t\tAdded fragment-aware state boundaries for syntax highlighting in diffs and other projections.\n\t\t\tRemoved overlapping viewport-wide regex rules for HTML and XML comments.",
